{
  "slug": "airwallex-agentos",
  "name": "Airwallex Agentos",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Bring Airwallex's global financial infrastructure to Claude. Orchestrate actions across your account in plain language, e.g., set up invoices from a PO, onboard suppliers from invoices, and check current cash position across currencies. AgentOS bundles pre-built finance Skills with MCP servers. A public CLI connects your agent to Airwallex's capabilities.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `awx-best-practices` (Fallback Airwallex skill — works with the Airwallex CLI or the Airwallex MCP server), `beneficiary-creation` (Extract bank details from supplier invoices or documents, validate per-country requirements, and create beneficiaries in Airwallex), `card-provisioning` (Provision virtual or physical corporate cards in Airwallex Issuing — create cardholders, issue cards with spend limits, and…), `contract-to-billing` (Extract billing details from purchase orders, contracts, or quotes, then set up Airwallex Billing by creating invoices and/or…), `manage-cashflow` (Multi-currency cash management — balances, receivables, obligations, FX exposure, runway, rebalancing, and indicative FX rates)\n- **MCP servers** (2): `airwallex-dev`, `airwallex-agentos`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install airwallex-agentos@claude-plugins-official` from `airwallex/airwallex-marketplace` (`plugins/airwallex-agentos`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "mcp": 2
  },
